   "summary": "This document section presents an extensive postwar statistical register and directory of educational institutions across Hiroshima Prefecture, continuing from an earlier page. It catalogues institutions under national, prefectural, municipal, and town or village jurisdictions, including higher schools, normal schools, colleges, vocational schools, middle schools, girls' high schools, youth schools, elementary schools, and kindergartens. For each institution, the register provides its name, romanized and translated titles, address by city or county district, date founded, and detailed gender breakdowns of student enrollment and teaching staff as of April 30, 1946, and November 30, 1946. Pages 298–300 duplicate pages 295–297 within the archival compilation, and the listings continue beyond the end of the section.",
